    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29f88fcb8d5f29a53155fe9c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "吸引着所有观众，像是在凶猛地告诉大家“我在这里！”……\n这种跑法──我还是第一次看见。",
      "source_fingerprint": "94bb8a2d15588f621f26c3284ec7b612e52168fd16b59c732012c6904016da37",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
