    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99d5e48b3be8d4da847e4763",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "每次都是这样，我讨厌自己这懦弱的个性……\n这种时候只能放弃挣扎想办法撑过去，也只能这样──",
      "source_fingerprint": "ecc9961e6b521bb4721b08806438c936aa69269f97ca4bc38c2fdfb3de6737aa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
