      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我抑制不住内心的激动，还想看更多她的跑法……\n我忍不住跑上前想向她搭话，但是──",
      "source_fingerprint": "c12087a89b6ecb2aced189e47eec941b6deeed01f146564676ecdd548ed07997",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
